    <description><![CDATA[<p><code>__main__.py</code>是 python 中的一個特殊檔案，它是在利用<code>python</code>指令執行一個壓縮檔或資料夾時首先被運行的檔案。例如以下專案：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"><span class="line"><span class="cl">example <span class="p">|</span>__main__.py
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">		<span class="p">|</span> a.py
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">|</span> b.py
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="p">|</span> c.py
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>在 cmd 執行<code>python example</code>後，會自動執行<code>python __main__.py</code>。<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup></p>]]></description>
</item>
